--- Enum Operator Tester ---
--- Member equality ---
PASS: member == itself
PASS: member == different member
PASS: member != different member
PASS: member != itself
PASS: member IS itself
PASS: member IS different member
PASS: same case name in another enum is different
PASS: member == its numeric value is false
PASS: member != its numeric value is true
PASS: member == NULL is false
PASS: member == string is false
--- Member values and text ---
PASS: explicit value
PASS: auto value after explicit
PASS: implicit first value
PASS: STR of member
PASS: BOOL of member
PASS: unknown member attribute -> Illegal operation
PASS: member name attribute is not exposed -> Illegal operation
--- Truthiness: members are always true, even with value 0 ---
PASS: IF on member with value 0
PASS: member OR 0
PASS: member AND 0
PASS: 0 OR member
PASS: IF treats member as true
--- Whole-enum comparisons ---
PASS: enum == itself
PASS: enum == another enum
PASS: enum != another enum
PASS: enum != itself
PASS: enum IS itself
PASS: enum IS another enum
PASS: enum == number -> Illegal operation
PASS: enum != number -> Illegal operation
--- Whole-enum logic and text ---
PASS: enum AND 1
PASS: enum AND 0
PASS: enum OR 0
PASS: 0 OR enum
PASS: enum AND enum
PASS: STR of enum
PASS: BOOL of enum
PASS: member lookup through the enum
--- Errors ---
PASS: missing case -> Enum 'Colors' has no case 'MISSING'
PASS: reassign a case -> Cannot reassign enum case 'RED'
PASS: LEN of an enum -> LEN is not supported for type 'Enum'
